  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localisation Alliance NLRC Coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Localisation Alliance is the consortium that is formed out of the different technical partners cooperating into 1 holistic and coordinated consortium. It exists out of Norcross, SwissRc, KenyaRC, NLRC and the 9 different participating partners. The localisation Alliance has a steering committee and a group of high level ambassadors/mentors and facilitators. The costs related to NLRC coordination fall in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
